  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Core UI Components**\n\nI\'m making excellent progress on the UI\'s backbone. Specifically, I\'ve started building the three main tabs. Right now, I\'m focusing on `HomeView.tsx` with a stylish header, promotional carousel, studio marquee, and introductory section. I\'m leveraging mock data initially for placeholders. The visual design is the current focus.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Views**\n\nI\'ve been fleshing out interactive features across the app. In the Home tab, I\'m integrating video playback with counters and overlays. The Store tab now includes purchase flows with payment modals for passes. Finally, the Profile tab will feature stats blocks, history selectors with cancellation options, and dynamic cancellation functionality.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now create `/src/components/HomeView.tsx`, representing the Studio Home Page (\351\246\226\351\241\265). It features:\n1. A live notice marquee rolling through announcements and events.\n2. Featured promotion banner carousels using motion fading transitions.\n3. Teacher grids introducing PLANA instructors with modal biography details (tags, bio rating, specializations, background).\n4. Videos grid with playing simulations mimicking actual dance class wraps and showcases. This fulfills standard user interface trends."
