    modified_response: "I will now create the Store page `/src/components/StoreView.tsx` allowing students to purchase lesson passes and unlimited cards. It incorporates:\n1. Card templates from PAYMENT_CARDS (Single pass, 10-Class pack, unlimited passes).\n2. Bulleted summaries of class privileges.\n3. Interactive coupon selection simulation (e.g. \"Summer Festival -\302\24520\" or \"First-Class Pass -\302\24510\") which instantly computes adjusted pricing.\n4. Simulated payment modal (supporting options like WeChat Pay, Alipay) with live transactional processing states that increase lesson passes in real-time. This ensures full functional integrity."
