  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Celebrating Initial Success**\n\nI\'m incredibly pleased! Both `lint_applet` and `compile_applet` ran perfectly on the first attempt. No warnings, no errors! I\'m genuinely thrilled; the app is stable, modular, fully typed, responsive, and ready for deployment.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the **PLANA Dance Class Booking Application** to replicate the precise layout, user flows, and aesthetic values shown in your provided screenshots. \n\nThe application is built using **React, Vite, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS (v4)**, passing all strict syntax audits with zero errors. All core interactive modules have been built as standalone files to ensure codebase modularity.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Design Pairings\n- **Mobile Emulator Shell**: The application is framed within a beautiful mobile emulator shell for desktop browsers (complete with a simulated smartphone status bar detailing network strengths, batteries, and clock). It automatically stretches to fill the screen on actual mobile devices.\n- **Teal & Charcoal Accents**: Polished colors directly matched from the screenshot branding (including a premium off-white canvas, sleek dividers, and custom status indicators).\n- **Aesthetic Avatars & Badges**: Prominent circular teacher grids with custom rating labels, style indicators (Hiphop, Jazz, Urban, Contemporary), and detailed course difficulty star lists (e.g. `\351\233\266\345\237\272\347\241\200\345\244\247\350\257\276`).\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\232\200 Functional Capabilities Implemented\n\n1. **\351\246\226\351\241\265 (Home Tab)**\n   - **Promotion Banner**: A sliding hero image carousel introducing bootcamps and growing classes (`\345\244\217\345\255\243\347\210\265\345\243\253\347\210\206\345\217\221\350\220\245`) with motion translations.\n   - **Notice Board**: A live rolling marquee ticker relaying announcements and alerts.\n   - **Teachers Bio sheet**: Interactive grids displaying professional coaches (Senish, MORNI, \346\213\276\346\237\222, \345\260\217\346\250\261). Clicking any avatar opens a detailed biographic drawer displaying tags, classes, and descriptions.\n   - **Video Showcase**: Video feedback card integrations simulating the play of actual dance class wraps.\n\n2. **\350\257\276\350\241\250 (Schedule - Core Booking View)**\n   - **\346\227\245\350\257\276\350\241\250 VS \345\221\250\350\257\276\350\241\250 Layouts**: Support both horizontal day swiping and a dense weekly timeline calendar matrix.\n   - **Toggles**: Toggle easily between Group (`\345\233\242\350\257\276`), Private (`\347\247\201\346\225\231`), and Series (`\347\217\255\350\257\276`) course categories.\n   - **Calendar Picker (Image 9)**: Click the calendar icon to trigger a beautiful overlay modal allowing fast date picking.\n   - **Filter Drawer (Image 8)**: Slide out a drawer filter option panel to isolate lessons matching specific classrooms (A\346\225\231\345\256\244, B\346\225\231\345\256\244, C\346\225\231\345\256\244) or teachers of choice.\n   - **Live Booking Actions**: Interactive state triggers where booking a class deducts user passes, and booking fully registered classes sets the button to\345\200\231\350\241\245 \"\346\216\222\351\230\237\" (Queue) with associated alerts. Cancel with a single click.\n\n3. **\345\225\206\345\237\216 (Store Tab)**\n   - Browse packages such as single experience cards, 10-Class cards, and unlimited monthly passes.\n   - **Coupon Selection**: Real-time coupon discounts (e.g., *\302\24515 New Client Discount* or *\302\24550 Store Special Discount*) automatically adjusted with live computing checkout states.\n   - Select payments (WeChat Pay, Alipay, Bank Card) completing with real-time pass wallet balance additions.\n\n4. **\346\210\221\347\232\204 (Profile Tab)**\n   - **Performance Chart**: Tracks preferred styles (Jazz, Hiphop, Urban) dynamically through stylized graphic indicators.\n   - Display important parameters: remaining passes, training streaks, total study hours, and level badges.\n   - **Detailed Booking Monitor**: Tab loops to review active bookings, waitlists, and historical transaction cards. Cancel dynamic reservations instantly from this page.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 718063463
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
