  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Vibrant Palette\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Vibrant Palette\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-indigo-50 font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-20 bg-white px-10 flex items-center justify-between border-b-4 border-yellow-400\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-rose-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-sm rotate-45\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter text-indigo-900\\\">STEP<span class=\\\"text-rose-500\\\">UP</span></span>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-900 border-b-4 border-rose-500 pb-1\\\">Classes</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">Workshops</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">Instructors</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">My Bookings</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <button class=\\\"bg-indigo-900 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-indigo-800\\\">\\n      Log In\\n    </button>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex gap-8 p-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Left Section: Featured & Grid -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-[2] flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Featured Workshop Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500 to-orange-400 rounded-3xl h-[300px] p-8 text-white flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden shadow-xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-10 right-20 w-32 h-32 bg-yellow-300 opacity-20 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"z-10\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"bg-yellow-400 text-indigo-900 px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-black uppercase mb-4 inline-block\\\">Featured Workshop</span>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-5xl font-black mb-2\\\">Contemporary Flow</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-lg opacity-90 max-w-lg mb-6\\\">Experience the fluid movement with Elena Rodriguez. A 2-hour masterclass on expression and balance.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex -space-x-3\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">+42 dancers joined</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"ml-auto bg-white text-rose-500 font-black px-8 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform\\\">Book Spot \342\200\224 $25</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Quick Selection Grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 h-full\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-indigo-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Street Jazz</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">Int./Advanced &bull; 60m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$18</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-rose-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-rose-100 text-rose-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Latin Heat</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">Beginner &bull; 45m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$15</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-rose-50 text-rose-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-yellow-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 11H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Morning Ballet</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">All Levels &bull; 90m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$22</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Section: Sidebar -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Schedule Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-900 rounded-[40px] p-8 text-white flex-1 flex flex-col shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-8\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black\\\">Your Weekly<br/>Flow</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/10 p-4 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-400 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\\\">Oct</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">12</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Street Dance Basics</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/60\\\">Studio A &bull; 18:30</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/10 p-4 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-indigo-900\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\\\">Oct</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">14</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Vogue Performance</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/60\\\">Main Hall &bull; 20:00</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-white/20\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-white/20\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\\\"></path></svg>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"font-bold text-white/40\\\">Book another class</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-yellow-400 rounded-3xl text-indigo-900\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-1 tracking-widest\\\">Studio Pass</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end\\\">\\n              <h4 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\">$149<span class=\\\"text-base font-bold\\\">/mo</span></h4>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold\\\">Unlimited Classes &rarr;</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Status/Notification Bar (Subtle) -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 bg-white px-10 flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n      <span>ACTIVE DANCERS: 1,420</span>\\n      <span>STUDIOS OPEN: 12</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n      <span>NEXT CLASS IN 14:02 MINUTES</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Vibrant Palette\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Vibrant Palette\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-indigo-50 font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Header Navigation -->\\n  <header class=\\\"h-20 bg-white px-10 flex items-center justify-between border-b-4 border-yellow-400\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-rose-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-sm rotate-45\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter text-indigo-900\\\">STEP<span class=\\\"text-rose-500\\\">UP</span></span>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-900 border-b-4 border-rose-500 pb-1\\\">Classes</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">Workshops</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">Instructors</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-400 hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors\\\">My Bookings</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <button class=\\\"bg-indigo-900 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-full font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-indigo-800\\\">\\n      Log In\\n    </button>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex gap-8 p-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Left Section: Featured & Grid -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-[2] flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Featured Workshop Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative bg-gradient-to-br from-rose-500 to-orange-400 rounded-3xl h-[300px] p-8 text-white flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden shadow-xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-white opacity-10 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-10 right-20 w-32 h-32 bg-yellow-300 opacity-20 rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"z-10\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"bg-yellow-400 text-indigo-900 px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-black uppercase mb-4 inline-block\\\">Featured Workshop</span>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-5xl font-black mb-2\\\">Contemporary Flow</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-lg opacity-90 max-w-lg mb-6\\\">Experience the fluid movement with Elena Rodriguez. A 2-hour masterclass on expression and balance.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-6\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex -space-x-3\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n              <div class=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-300 border-2 border-white\\\"></div>\\n            </div>\\n            <span class=\\\"font-bold\\\">+42 dancers joined</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"ml-auto bg-white text-rose-500 font-black px-8 py-3 rounded-2xl shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform\\\">Book Spot \342\200\224 $25</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Quick Selection Grid -->\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 h-full\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-indigo-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M9 19V6l12-3v13M9 19c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zm12-3c0 1.105-1.343 2-3 2s-3-.895-3-2 1.343-2 3-2 3 .895 3 2zM9 10l12-3\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Street Jazz</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">Int./Advanced &bull; 60m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$18</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-900 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-rose-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-rose-100 text-rose-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Latin Heat</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">Beginner &bull; 45m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$15</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-rose-50 text-rose-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-md border-b-8 border-yellow-200 flex flex-col\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\" d=\\\"M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 11H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-black text-indigo-900 mb-1\\\">Morning Ballet</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-indigo-400 text-sm mb-4\\\">All Levels &bull; 90m</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-auto flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"font-black text-indigo-900 text-lg\\\">$22</span>\\n            <button class=\\\"w-10 h-10 bg-yellow-50 text-yellow-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold\\\">+</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Section: Sidebar -->\\n    <div class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n      <!-- Schedule Card -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-indigo-900 rounded-[40px] p-8 text-white flex-1 flex flex-col shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-center mb-8\\\">\\n          <h2 class=\\\"text-2xl font-black\\\">Your Weekly<br/>Flow</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 bg-white/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n            <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\"></path></svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/10 p-4 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-orange-400 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\\\">Oct</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">12</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Street Dance Basics</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/60\\\">Studio A &bull; 18:30</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/10 p-4 rounded-2xl\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-400 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-indigo-900\\\">\\n              <span class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\\\">Oct</span>\\n              <span class=\\\"text-lg font-black leading-none\\\">14</span>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-bold\\\">Vogue Performance</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-white/60\\\">Main Hall &bull; 20:00</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-white/5 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-white/20\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 flex items-center justify-center text-white/20\\\">\\n              <svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M12 4v16m8-8H4\\\"></path></svg>\\n            </div>\\n            <p class=\\\"font-bold text-white/40\\\">Book another class</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"mt-auto\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"p-6 bg-yellow-400 rounded-3xl text-indigo-900\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-xs font-black uppercase mb-1 tracking-widest\\\">Studio Pass</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex justify-between items-end\\\">\\n              <h4 class=\\\"text-3xl font-black\\\">$149<span class=\\\"text-base font-bold\\\">/mo</span></h4>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-sm font-bold\\\">Unlimited Classes &rarr;</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Bottom Status/Notification Bar (Subtle) -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-12 bg-white px-10 flex items-center justify-between text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold border-t border-gray-100\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6\\\">\\n      <span>ACTIVE DANCERS: 1,420</span>\\n      <span>STUDIOS OPEN: 12</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 bg-green-400 rounded-full animate-pulse\\\"></div>\\n      <span>NEXT CLASS IN 14:02 MINUTES</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
