    thinking: "**Updating the View**\n\nI\'m now focusing on theming `StoreView.tsx` with the Vibrant Palette. I\'ve examined the visual updates needed, starting with the container. I want to tweak the styling from `flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 pb-20 pt-2 bg-slate-50` to `flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 pb-2`.\n\n\n**Adjusting UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now changing the styling of the header and notice banner. For the header, I\'m updating the `flex` properties, and color. As for the notice banner, I have updated the `bg` color, border, padding, and border radius as well as text colors. I\'m also revising the card package heading\'s text to include a tracking adjustment. The individual cards now have a shadow, and border.\n\n\n**Refining Element Styling**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on fine-tuning the visual aspects. I\'ve switched the discount indicator\'s background and text colors. I\'ve also updated the purchase trigger button with a new background, hover effect, border, and text color, as well as a new rounded style. The security notes card now has a new color scheme. I\'ve also switched some header fonts. Finally, I\'ve re-styled the price label, and purchase symbol.\n\n\n**Refining Further Elements**\n\nI\'m now diving into the checkout drawer adjustments. The container is updated with rounded corners and a border; I\'ve shifted the coupon selector button appearance using a different border, background, text, and font. I am working through the normal choices. Finally, I\'m refactoring the channel selection and the trigger controls button.\n\n\n"
