    modified_response: "I have completed the comprehensive redesign to provide a professional, premium street-academy interface for the **Dance Class Booking App**. \n\n### \360\237\216\250 Design & Theme Transition (Neon Obsidian Chrome Theme)\n*   **Aesthetic Alignment**: Replaced bright yellows, cartoons, and pale indigo surfaces with a deep, expensive-looking matte canvas (`#0c0d14` and `#13141f`), paired with micro-shadowing, soft gradient backgrounds, and electric grape accents.\n*   **Visual Elements**: Configured sleek graphite modular tiles, ultra-fine semi-translucent borders (`border-white/5`), beautiful custom status indicators, and balanced proportions of negative space.\n*   **Typography**: Implemented elegant high-contrast display text (pure white coupled with slate-grey descriptors) to establish clear hierarchy and premium street-cred.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\222\273 Key Redesign Highlights Across All Views\n1.  **Schedule Blueprint (`ScheduleView`)**:\n    *   Transitioned daily class cards, calendar pickers, and filter drawers into thin dark tiles with soft glowing borders.\n    *   Integrated clean state pills for difficulty stars, class rooms, and available ratios.\n    *   Designed premium, high-apparel style booking trigger controls (pristine monochrome white action pills) and automatic waitlist queue state buttons.\n2.  **Memberships Store (`StoreView`)**:\n    *   Polished the packages, cards, and shop banners with rich glowing gradients and subtle shadows.\n    *   Refined the secure billing checkout sheet drawer with cards coupon pickers, step-by-step cost breakdowns, and WeChat/Alipay payment channel selectors.\n3.  **Member Control Center (`ProfileView`)**:\n    *   Renovated the dancer dashboard with a dark holographic card interface containing stats tracking (e.g., remaining booking points, learning hours).\n    *   Updated the dance genre progress distributions and learning charts with vibrant fills and integrated custom hot-street streak badges."
