 Appended a clean, custom-styled system row at the bottom of the profile\'s scroll region labeled **\"\345\210\207\346\215\242\343\200\201\351\200\200\345\207\272\345\275\223\345\211\215\345\276\256\344\277\241\345\217\267\347\231\273\345\275\225\"**.\n    *   Clicking it safely resets the authorized state, clears localStorage cache markers, and rolls back with a toast message to the WeChat login screen.\n"
